<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Synergia IPO priced at 650 Bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian Synergia IPO priced at 650 Bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares being sold by Belgian holding company Synergia in an initial public offering (IPO) on Brussels Euro.NM market have been priced at 650 Belgian francs, the brokerages managing the offer said in a statement.</p>
<p>Synergia is offering 645,000 shares for sale, of which a part is reserved for institutional investors. The public offering began Friday and runs until May 22 at the latest.</p>
<p>The IPO is being managed by Bank Indosuez Belgium and Nedee &amp; Co, both units of Belgian CERA Bank.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
